Package: vabaxos-update
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, packagekit, flatpak
Description: Update VabaxOS with every step said aloud
 vabaxos-update checks, downloads and installs updates of the system and
 of Flatpak applications through PackageKit, and says what happens:
 how many updates, how many for security, progress, whether a restart is
 needed (ADR-0020). Updates can be installed now or at the next start. A
 daily check speaks only when security updates are ready.
